{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "23", "x": 0.904017983697097, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.029725264906538765, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "uplifting messages ourselves. If we observe negative posts, such as complaints", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.12319506908974809, "w": 0.8263880622814488, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "about a long queue at the coffee shop, we will in turn create more negative posts.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.15152541916388573, "w": 0.8268583442445515, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "In some ways, many of us now live as if we are in danger, constantly ready to tackle", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.17970752416545568, "w": 0.8264470141298866, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "demanding emails and text messages, and respond to news alerts and comments", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2080378742395933, "w": 0.8265582537047649, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "on social media. Repeatedly checking your phone, according to a survey", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.23636822431373095, "w": 0.8260335309911918, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "conducted by the American Psychological Association, is related to stress. In", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.26469857438786853, "w": 0.8258812814347917, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "other words, a pre-programmed physiological reaction, which evolution has", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2930660423122369, "w": 0.8263618158932748, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "equipped us with to help us avoid famished predators, is now being triggered by", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.32139637352567824, "w": 0.8260279946436863, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "an online post. Social media posting, according to one study, raises your pulse,", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3497267990426009, "w": 0.826099044436673, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "makes you sweat, and enlarges your pupils more than most daily activities.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3780571491167385, "w": 0.7615152952364959, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "The fact that stress increases the likelihood that we will focus more on alarming", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.40638753691226864, "w": 0.8261346205956434, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "messages, together with the fact that it spreads extremely rapidly, can create", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4347178869864063, "w": 0.8261425150170862, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "collective fear that is not always justified. After a stressful public event, such as", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4630482747819364, "w": 0.825968325120572, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "a natural disaster or major financial crash, there is often a wave of alarming", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.49140337008956114, "w": 0.8262539596418721, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "information in traditional and social media, which individuals become very aware", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5197337201636988, "w": 0.8260553688063522, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "of. But that has the effect of exaggerating existing danger. And so, a reliable", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5480641079592289, "w": 0.8260333259412842, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "pattern emerges - stress is triggered, spreading from one person to the next,", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5763944580333665, "w": 0.8264582918748051, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "which temporarily enhances the likelihood that people will take in negative", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6047248458288966, "w": 0.8260768990466512, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "reports, which increases stress further. As a result, trips are cancelled, even if the", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6330551959030343, "w": 0.8260335309911918, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "disaster took place across the globe; stocks are sold, even when holding on is the", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6612743433120499, "w": 0.8266633417824147, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "best thing to do.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6896046933861876, "w": 0.16996786765422803, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "The good news, however, is that positive emotions, such as hope, are contagious", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7179351189031102, "w": 0.8259028116750906, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "too, and are powerful in inducing people to act to find solutions. Being aware of", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7462654689772478, "w": 0.8261205746769721, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "the close relationship between people's emotional state and how they process", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7745958190513854, "w": 0.826602236909947, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "information can help us frame our messages more effectively and become", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8029261691255231, "w": 0.826033428466238, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "conscientious agents of change.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8312565191996607, "w": 0.3326870929182631, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}